You are given an array $A$ of $N$ integers and a positive integer $K$. You can perform the following operation on the array any number of times (possibly zero):

- Choose an index $i$ ($1 \leq i \leq N$) and replace $A_i$ with $\lfloor \frac{A_i}{K} \rfloor$.

