#### Honest Solution
The honest solution calculates the minimum time needed to prepare all dishes. For \( N \leq 2 \), it returns the maximum cooking time since placing all dishes on one burner would take the longest. For \( N > 2 \), it sums all cooking times because they can all be done in parallel.

