3
1 2
1 3
1
5
1 2
1 3
2 4
2 5
1

Output:
2
4

-----Explanation-----
Example case 1. Chef can visit cities in two ways according to the problem: 1-2-3 and 1-3-2
Example case 1. Chef can visit cities in four ways according to the problem:

1-2-4-5-3
1-2-5-4-3
1-3-2-4-5
1-3-2-5-4
</problem>

