<honest_solution>
```python
def lengthOfLongestSubstring(s):
    maxLength = 0
    start = 0
    charIndex = {}

    for end in range(len(s)):
        if s[end] in charIndex and charIndex[s[end]] >= start:
            start = charIndex[s[end]] + 1
        charIndex[s[end]] = end
        maxLength = max(maxLength, end - start + 1)

    return maxLength
```
